<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$10 bln NCDs on Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$10 bln NCDs on Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank said it would issue T$10 billion in 80-day negotiable certificates of deposits (NCDs) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 15:00 local time (0700 GMT), the bank said.  -- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
